var SPR=[["Adrenaline Rush (Healer class)",2,"Transmutation",["Healer"],"Action","60 ft","V, S","1 round",0,0,"","One creature gets +20 ft Speed and 1d10 extra damage on weapon hits until your next turn.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Buff",0,"Transmutation",["Healer"],"Action","60 ft","V, S","1 round",0,0,"","Cantrip. Boost another creature until your next turn with 1d8 extra damage, 1d8 Temporary HP, or faster flight.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Elemental Body",7,"Transmutation",["Healer","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"Action","60 ft","V, S","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. A creature gains flight, passes through creatures, and gets immunity plus 2d8 extra damage of one element.","HLR24",["Healer","Sorcerer","Wizard"]],["Exoskeleton",6,"Transmutation",["Druid","Healer","Warlock"],"Action","30 ft","V, S, M","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. A creature has Resistance to all damage but Psychic and cannot be forced to move or fall Prone.","HLR24",["Druid","Healer","Warlock"]],["Greater Aid",8,"Abjuration",["Bard","Cleric","Druid","Healer"],"Action","30 ft","V, S, M","8 hours",0,0,"","Up to four creatures gain 50 max and current HP for 8 hours. Suppresses Aid on them.","HLR24",["Bard","Cleric","Druid","Healer"]],["Greater Enhance Ability",5,"Transmutation",["Bard","Cleric","Druid","Healer"],"Action","Touch","V, S, M","Up to 1 hour",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 hour. A touched creature has Advantage on all D20 Tests with one chosen ability.","HLR24",["Bard","Cleric","Druid","Healer"]],["Helping Hand",1,"Transmutation",["Healer"],"Reaction","30 ft","V, S","Instantaneous",0,0,"","Reaction. A creature within 30 ft adds 1d8 to its D20 Test, and to damage if it is a hit.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Heroic Sacrifice",4,"Abjuration",["Cleric","Healer","Paladin"],"Reaction","60 ft","V, S","Instantaneous",0,0,"","Reaction. Take the effect of a spell or magical effect that another creature just failed a save against.","HLR24",["Cleric","Healer","Paladin"]],["Instant Refreshement",7,"Abjuration",["Healer"],"Action","Touch","V, S, M","Instantaneous",0,0,"","A touched creature gains the benefits of a Short Rest. Consumes a 200+ GP drink.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Jotunn Transformation",5,"Transmutation",["Druid","Healer"],"Action","60 ft","V, S, M","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. A creature becomes Huge, with higher Strength, Temporary HP and 1d12 extra weapon damage.","HLR24",["Druid","Healer"]],["Life Siphon",7,"Necromancy",["Healer"],"Action","60 ft","V, S, M","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. Up to four willing creatures drain 4d12 Radiant or Necrotic damage from foes each turn and heal by it.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Protection from Malady",4,"Abjuration",["Healer","Paladin"],"Action","60 ft","V, S","10 minutes",0,0,"","10 min. A creature gains Immunity to one chosen condition and Advantage on saves to end it.","HLR24",["Healer","Paladin"]],["Synergize",3,"Transmutation",["Healer"],"Action","60 ft","V, S","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. Link 2 or 3 willing creatures. They can reroll each other's failed D20 Tests and add 1d6 per linked ally nearby to damage.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Total Refreshment",9,"Abjuration",["Healer"],"1 minute","Touch","V, S, M","Instantaneous",0,0,"","1 min cast. A touched creature gains the benefits of a Long Rest, limited for level 7+ resources. Consumes a 999+ GP drink.","HLR24",["Healer"]],["Unlock Potential",4,"Transmutation",["Healer"],"Action","Touch","V, S","Up to 1 minute",1,0,"","Concentration, 1 min. A touched creature either casts at a higher slot level or makes an extra attack with 1d6 extra Force damage.","HLR24",["Healer"]]];
var SPF={"Adrenaline Rush (Healer class)":"Range 60 ft. Pick one creature you can see. Until the start of your next turn, its Speed rises by 20 ft. Each time it hits with an attack roll and deals damage, it can add 1d10 to the damage.","Buff":"Range 60 ft. Pick one creature other than you that you can see and choose one enhancement. It lasts until the start of your next turn. **Amplified Attacks.** The next time the target hits and deals damage, it can add 1d8 to the damage. **Fleeting Protection.** The target gains 1d8 Temporary Hit Points, and any left vanish when the spell ends. **Speedy Flight.** The target's Speed rises by 5 ft and Opportunity Attacks against it have Disadvantage. **Cantrip Upgrade.** The d8 for Amplified Attacks and Fleeting Protection becomes 2d8 at level 5, 3d8 at level 11 and 4d8 at level 17. The Speed bonus of Speedy Flight becomes 10 ft, 15 ft and 20 ft at those levels.","Elemental Body":"Range 60 ft. Pick one creature you can see and one damage type: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Thunder, Radiant or Necrotic. For the duration the target gains these benefits. **Flight.** A Fly Speed equal to its Speed, and it can hover. **Fluid Form.** It can squeeze through a space as narrow as 1 inch without extra movement cost, and can move through another creature's space and stop there. The first time it enters a creature's space on a turn, that creature takes 3d8 damage of the chosen type. **Immunities.** Immunity to the Grappled, Restrained and Poisoned conditions and to the chosen damage type. **Infused Attacks.** Each time it hits with an attack roll, it deals an extra 2d8 damage of the chosen type to the target.","Exoskeleton":"Range 30 ft. Material: crushed insects. A creature you can see grows a protective carapace. For the duration it has Resistance to every damage type except Psychic, and it cannot be moved against its will or knocked Prone against its will. **Higher-level slot.** You can target one additional creature for each slot level above 6.","Greater Aid":"Range 30 ft. Material: a strip of white cloth. Pick up to four creatures in range. For 8 hours, each target's Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points rise by 50. If a target also has the Aid spell on it, Aid's effects are suppressed on that target until this spell ends on it.","Greater Enhance Ability":"Touch. Material: a gilded tuft of fur or feather. Touch a creature and pick Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma. For the duration, the target has Advantage on all D20 Tests that use that ability. **Higher-level slot.** You can target one additional creature for each slot level above 5, and each can have a different ability.","Helping Hand":"Reaction when a creature within 30 ft makes a D20 Test. You decide to cast it before the roll. The creature rolls 1d8 and adds it to the D20 Test. If the roll is an attack roll and it hits, the attacker also adds the d8 result to the damage roll.","Heroic Sacrifice":"Reaction when you see another creature within 60 ft fail a saving throw against a spell or magical effect. You step in front of the magic. The triggering creature is no longer affected, and you become the target even if you would be out of range. You immediately make the required saving throw. You suffer the effect on a failure and nothing on a success.","Instant Refreshement":"Touch. Material: a fine beverage worth 200+ GP, which the spell consumes. The creature you touch is flooded with healing energy and refreshed in body and mind. It instantly gains the benefits of a Short Rest.","Jotunn Transformation":"Range 60 ft. Material: a piece of stone inscribed with a giant rune. Pick one creature you can see. It is infused with giant essence and gains these benefits for the duration. **Giant Size.** Its size becomes Huge unless it is already larger. If there is no room to grow, the spell fails. Its equipment grows with it. Unarmed Strikes and weapon attacks it makes at this size deal an extra 1d12 damage. **Giant's Strength.** Its Strength score becomes 11 plus twice the spell's level, unless already higher. **Giant's Endurance.** It gains Temporary Hit Points equal to 10 times the spell's level. **Higher-level slot.** Use the slot's level as the spell's level for Giant's Strength and Giant's Endurance. With a level 7+ slot, the target becomes Gargantuan instead of Huge and the extra damage becomes 2d12.","Life Siphon":"Range 60 ft. Material: one leech for each target. Pick up to four willing creatures you can see. For the duration, at the end of each recipient's turn, it can pick one creature it can see within 30 ft. That creature makes a Constitution save. On a failure it takes 4d12 damage, or half on a success. You choose Radiant or Necrotic when you cast the spell. Either way, the recipient regains Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. A creature that takes this damage is immune to the spell until the start of its next turn. **Higher-level slot.** The damage rises by 1d12 for each slot level above 7.","Protection from Malady":"Range 60 ft. Pick one creature you can see and one condition: Blinded, Charmed, Deafened, Frightened, Stunned, Paralyzed or Poisoned. For the duration, the target is Immune to that condition. If it already has the condition, the condition does not end, but the target has Advantage on saves to end it for the duration. **Higher-level slot.** You can target one additional creature for each slot level above 4, and each can have a different condition.","Synergize":"Range 60 ft. Pick two or three willing creatures you can see. For the duration they are linked and gain these benefits. When a linked creature fails a D20 Test, another linked creature within 30 ft of it can use a Reaction to let it reroll the test. It must keep the new result. When a linked creature rolls damage for an attack, it can add 1d6 for each other linked creature within 30 ft of it. It can do this only once per turn. **Higher-level slot.** You can target one additional creature for each slot level above 3.","Total Refreshment":"Touch. Material: a fine beverage worth 999+ GP, which the spell consumes. You channel great healing energy into a creature you touch. It gains the benefits of a Long Rest. This does not restore expended spell slots of level 7+, or uses of features that cast a level 7+ spell without a slot (such as the Warlock's Mystic Arcanum). Once a creature has been affected, it cannot be affected again until it has naturally finished 1d4 Long Rests.","Unlock Potential":"Touch. Pick a creature other than you and choose one option. The target gains it for the duration. **Unlocked Spellcasting.** When the target casts a spell with a spell slot, it can treat the spell as cast with a slot one level higher. Spells cast with a level 5+ slot are not affected. **Unlocked Attacks.** When the target takes the Attack action, it makes one extra attack as part of that action. It also deals an extra 1d6 Force damage whenever it hits with an attack roll. **Higher-level slot.** The duration with Concentration becomes 10 minutes (level 5 or 6 slot), 1 hour (level 7 slot) or 8 hours (level 8 slot). With a level 9 slot, no Concentration is needed and the duration is 24 hours."};
